<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;" size="4">Dear&nbsp;</font><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">{!IndividualApplication.COE_Approver__c}</font><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: large;">,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">We are delighted to inform you that your project proposal, <b>{!IndividualApplication.Project_Title__c}</b>, has been <b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">approved</b> for funding under the <b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">Wadhwani
Innovation Network (WIN)</b>.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">The project will be funded on a <b>milestone-based model</b>,
as per the milestones outlined in your submitted proposal. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">We look forward to seeing the impact of your innovation
journey.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="4">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">Sincerely,</span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;"><b style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px;">Wadhwani Foundation</b>]]></td>
